#6604
The Gathering Place~
You come out into a wide flat area lit by torches. Around you are
little groups of huddled people wearing ill-fitting dirty white
robes. They all look apprehensive and occasionally cast nervous
glances at two tall priestly figures standing on either side
of a doorway carved into the rock opposite where you have entered.
It is from the doorway that the glow, you noticed earlier, leaps
and flickers, accompanied buy a soft roaring noise. To your right is 
dimly light sign.
~
