sign~
WELCOME Pilgrims..Behold the Temple of Time.
As you have heard this place is a place where
the streams of Time sometimes overflow and burn
a hole thru to our world. Legend tells that 
one in a million who enter to seek the knowledge
of all Time, shall receive that prize. 
But for the rest... nothing but a horrible death
awaits you at the hands of He Who Guards The
Gates of Time
~
