#6605
The Doorway To Yesterday~
As you approach the doorway the light from within grows
hurtfully bright and begins to pulsate. The priests on either
side off the doorway wave their hands at you and they chant
loudly. You wonder if their prayers are for you to receive
a quick and merciful death rather than wander the halls slowly
dying of starvation. After all there is NO way out except by
dying, except for the one selected by the guardian among the
hundreds and thousands who have entered and died for untold years. 
~
