#6606
The Well of Forever~
Before you is a low stone wall enclosing a hole some forty feet across
and within is a glowing, spinning, misty pinwheel.Your face is bathed
in an unearthly radiance as whispy tentacles of plasma reach towards
you. A clamor of infinite voices pours forth in a roaring babble that
assails your ears till you cry out and clap your hands over them!
      a dreadful whisper comes through the roar and says,

                   'Welcome To Never'


~
