#6607
Forever~
You take a deep breath and step forward,

Down
    n
     n
      n
       n
        n
         n you fall, flailing wildly as you are swallowed up
in a vast spinning whirlpool of light and sound.

your stomach LURCHES as a dizzying wave of nausea passes thru you

With a sickening elevator-drop sensation your fall accelarates and
you begin to scream soundlessly.

You Fall and
            Fall
               and
                  Fall
finally with a light bump, you recover to find yourself on a plain
marble floor. Getting to your feet you stumble forward.
~
